WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.510
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.720
Rei-chan, please!

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.100
I'll continue to exterminate all <i>yokai</i>!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.700
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:07.600
<i>It's an emergency!</i>

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:10.350
<i>Enma-Daio was eaten by
the Kyubi no Kitsune!</i>

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.360
<i>The underworld has fallen to her!</i>

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.730
What?!

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:16.610
Finger Guns!

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:26.250
An attack like that is
hardly enough to defeat me.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.850
You! Who goes there?!

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:34.070
Intruders must die!

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:42.200
I may need more than one tail for this.

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:46.100
Stop!

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:49.480
I'll let you live for now.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:56.340
Be sure to watch as the foundations of
this world and the next crumble.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:02:59.470
CHAPTER 75

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:04.490
KYUBI NO KITSUNE

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.960
Rei Isurugi.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:14.960
Give up and return
the souls of my friends.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:20.030
Sure...

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.820
Why...?

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:29.810
<i>On</i>!

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.420
CLOTH

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:34.480
You!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:38.110
I need more power to defeat Tamamo-no-Mae.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:42.740
That's why I need to become
much, much stronger!

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:46.430
Kitaro, I'll obtain your soul as well!

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:48.850
Isurugi...!

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:52.690
CRY

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.050
I'm going to the underworld.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.180
What?!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:07.580
If Kitaro's going to decide on his own
to try to keep me from harm,

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:11.810
then I'll just fight for Kitaro
on my own, too!

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:14.000
You mean we will!

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:16.810
Please! Let me come, too!

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:20.480
What are you talking about?!
You could never...

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.000
You're right.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.160
Forcing my decision
would be no different from Kitaro.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.540
Cat-san.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:38.000
But it'll definitely be dangerous.

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:41.380
Going to the underworld is
already a big deal.

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:46.180
I'm sure the Kyubi will detect us
using the Yomotsu Hirasaka or Ghost Train.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:50.390
The underworld exists for other countries,
not just Japan, right?

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.690
I think so.

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:55.060
In that case, Kagami-Jijii-san!

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:57.060
I've got a request!

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:01.690
What?! The Kyubi no Kitsune?!

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.910
Yeah! The underworld's in chaos!

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:07.720
Everyone's panicked and ready to flee!

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.600
D-Dammit!

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:14.670
<i>I'm going to be the one responsible!</i>

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:15.790
<i>I'll be the one...</i>

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:20.210
That hag's no good!
I'm not going through another war!

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:21.690
SAND

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.610
CRY

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.610
Summon Crybaby!

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.910
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:55.000
Dad, what's happening?!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.460
He's absorbed too many souls.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:01.260
Isurugi! That's more power than
a human can contain!

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:03.340
At that rate you'll die!

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:07.110
I don't care what happens to me!

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.020
<i>Yokai</i> are evil!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:16.060
The Kidoshu were born to
protect humans from <i>yokai</i>!

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:21.210
That's why I'll continue the Kidoshu way
even if I'm the last one!

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:25.320
I'll continue to exterminate all <i>yokai</i>!

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.510
How's that, GeGeGe no Kitaro?!

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:47.430
How cheap, Rei Isurugi.

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:48.760
What?!

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:52.850
<i>Yokai</i> are evil. Humans are good.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:56.500
It's not... that simple.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:59.480
There are good <i>yokai</i>.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:02.750
And hopeless humans as well.

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:08.980
To pass judgement on others
based on your own values...

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:10.070
is foolish.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:16.870
That's the last thing I'd ever want to do!

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:19.370
That's what I thought!

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.370
And yet...!

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:23.920
But at least let me
worry and struggle with you!

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:27.460
Let me be one of your friends, too!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.750
Seeing you made me realize

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:49.440
that I still want to dream.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:52.200
To dream?

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:53.370
Yeah.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.800
Maybe it's a foolish dream.

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:01.460
But I'd like to aim for it again.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.770
That's why I...

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:10.400
I can't ever let you...

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:13.720
defeat me!

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:17.620
Summon Wally Wall!

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.120
WALL

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:20.850
Wh-Why? Why won't it come?!

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:26.540
Crybaby! Sand Witch! Cloth! I summon you!

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:24.540
CRY

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:25.420
SAND

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:26.540
CLOTH

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.050
S-Stop it!

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:33.370
Dammit! Let go!

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:35.160
You're just souls!

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:00.560
Any who would defy Tamamo-no-Mae-sama
is an enemy!

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:02.560
Is an enemy!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.600
<i>Dainaga mi torchi!</i>

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:14.280
It looks like all the guardians are indeed
under that Tamamo-no-Mae's control.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.360
I knew it.

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:19.350
We were right to enter from
the Western underworld!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:23.000
Thank you Agnes, Adele-san.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.960
We owe both you and Kitaro a debt.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:29.790
But that Kagami-Jijii-san
you had deliver your message...

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:34.190
<i>Hey! Agnes-chan, you there?!</i>

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:35.990
What manner of being are you?!

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:41.060
At any rate, we'd better get moving.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:42.060
Right.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.070
Is this the bottom of the underworld?

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:55.070
An unbelievable amount
of spirit energy is pouring out.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:02.180
You're the underworld guards!

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:04.410
You're Catchick.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.410
Things are really bad!

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:10.730
She's absorbed the power of the crucible.
It's complete chaos!

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:15.880
We must do something or
this world and that of the living will...!

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:22.120
Ibukimaru-san's paper charm?

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:27.000
That's it! He's being held here, right?

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:32.790
We've got...

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.610
A favor.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:37.300
Huh?

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:41.660
KYUBI NO KITSUNE

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:46.160
KYUBI NO KITSUNE ATTACKS!

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:45.060
-<i>"Oh no..."</i>
-<i>"No passing."</i>

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:46.060
<i>"You're out!!"</i>

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.480
Isurugi.

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:57.090
If you die you'll never have your revenge.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.860
Return everyone's souls now!

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:05.180
Rei-chan...

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:06.690
Please stop.

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:09.180
Please return their souls.

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:12.500
Rei-chan, please!

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:22.010
I'm transferring the souls to you
with the spell.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:26.350
SAND

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:37.000
CLOTH / CRY / WALL / SAND

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:39.030
NUE

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:39.130
You'll need this one, too.

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:47.810
I'm going after Tamamo-no-Mae.

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:51.210
Suit yourself.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:53.380
Rollo Cloth.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:02.260
<i>Everyone... I'm sorry.</i>

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:06.510
<i>I won't be able to avenge you.</i>

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:08.810
Pathetic.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.380
You?

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:16.610
How...?

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:23.970
The <i>yorimashi</i> girl, Mana, gave me freedom,
limited as it is.

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:32.730
Descendent of the Kidoshu, do you still
seek to exterminate all <i>yokai</i>?

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.610
Not all of them.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:39.820
But I can't accept all of them either.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.570
Then what will you do?

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:42.740
How should I know?

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:46.450
Don't ask people questions
you couldn't answer yourself!

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:51.500
I couldn't, he... Kitaro couldn't,
and even you couldn't!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:54.790
We all suffer without
being able to find an answer!

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:59.290
All I can do is continue to struggle.

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:05.760
I think and think and think and act,

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:09.100
hoping I'll someday reach an answer.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.250
I just continue my struggle!

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:15.560
Very well.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:20.500
Rei Isurugi, I bestow this power unto you.

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:23.570
Prime Minister, we're out of time!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.180
Your decision on an attack!

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:28.660
-Prime Minister!
-Prime Minister!!

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:29.910
Prime Minister!

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:35.600
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, right there!

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:39.290
You're not making
any stupid decisions are you?!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.670
Y-You...!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.340
From the purifier scandal!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.990
Dammit, forget about that!

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:47.140
Just try ordering an attack!

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:50.100
<i>A cabinet minister's chair would be easy!</i>

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:53.560
<i>The public is a bunch of idiots.
We can fool them easily.</i>

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:55.810
I'll spread this on the internet!

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:58.770
Are you trying to blackmail
the prime minister of a country?!

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.500
Just don't do anything funny!

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.970
Kitaro will take care of this!

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:16.830
Oh no, Kitaro!

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:20.580
At this rate the dead will spill over
into the world of the living!

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:22.250
Right, Dad!

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:25.840
Tamamo-no-Mae!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:28.760
It looks like you're
quite enjoying yourself.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:32.760
Obviously. I have that power now.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.250
But that ends here!

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:45.900
Hair Needles!

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:50.660
WALL

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:54.410
Wally Wall!

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:00.540
WALL / CRY / CLOTH / SAND

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.900
You guys...

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:04.170
We'll help you out!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:05.720
Use us well!

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:07.760
No need to hold back!

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.030
Thanks!

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.850
Dust Fan!

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.230
Finger Guns!

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:28.570
I don't even have to transmit here.
I can draw upon the power directly.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.070
You'll have to do better than that!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:34.560
Then I'll just do it
until you can't come back!

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:45.040
Hey, Kitaro! Are you all right?!

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:48.800
Could that second one be...?

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:52.010
She's summoned back all of her duplicates!

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.710
This is the end!

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:06.820
Oh no!

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:17.700
What are you just lying there for?

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:21.960
Rei Isurugi?

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.540
That form...

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:27.130
I have given him my power.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.170
Oh! Ibukimaru!

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:34.680
You may have backup, but so long as
we're in the underworld, I'm invincible!

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:38.640
Here goes!

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:43.810
I'll hold them off here!

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.110
Agnes and Adele, hurry!

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:47.280
Got it!

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:48.960
Let's do it, Agnes!

00:16:57.890 --> 00:16:59.790
<i>Lavik himumaya!</i>

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:14.800
The power...

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:15.840
It's stopped?!

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:18.470
What's going on?

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:23.140
Mana and Catchick have stopped
the flow of power to her.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:25.890
Together with the Western witches.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:28.590
Mana and the others are here?!

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:34.740
But I still have the power I've saved up.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:38.620
Behold! The true power of Tamamo-no-Mae!

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:51.380
If Mana and the others are fighting,

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:54.380
then I can't fall here!

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.750
Curse you!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:15.300
Oh no you don't!

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:19.080
Everyone, here goes!

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:20.120
Right!

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:22.390
Take this!

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:38.640
I-Impossible!

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:41.700
How could I...?!

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:02.470
What was I...?

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:05.680
Your Majesty!
We await your order to attack Japan!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.960
Call it off right now!

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:09.960
What?!

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:12.710
Take it.

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:13.760
Huh?

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:15.280
You need it, right?

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:26.680
It looks like Enma-Daio's back safely.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.460
He's a tough one.

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:30.460
Kitaro!

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:33.500
Catchick.

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:35.440
Idiot!

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.720
What's this about you doing it for me?!

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:45.350
If we lost you because of me,

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:50.370
how do you think it would make me feel?!

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:59.090
Cat-san...

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:03.240
I'm sorry, Catchick, Mana.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.350
I'll never do it again.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:10.330
So, from now on

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:14.000
will you continue to be my friends?

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:41.380
I heard what happened,
so I thought I'd pay my respects.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:45.490
What will you do now?

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:49.080
This one still remains a fledgling.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.860
For the time being
I shall train him as he travels.

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:57.150
Ibukimaru-san?!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:00.070
Hey, who told you to show yourself?!

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:02.490
I have Enma-Daio's permission.

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.030
Half of me remains in the underworld.

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:08.810
The other half shall train this one in
the world of the living.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:12.020
Honestly, nobody asked you!

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:18.440
Give him a message for me.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:21.380
Well...

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.800
Tell him, "I'll defeat you someday."

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:34.310
Hmph! You'll never beat Kitaro!

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:42.710
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:42.780
That takes care of that.

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:45.950
Wait. Didn't he beat you guys?

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:45.880
<i>Ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:47.530
You're just letting him go?

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:50.970
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:51.080
Well, I suppose he did
put us through a lot.

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:56.750
But, as thanks for saving the underworld,
we got restored right away.

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:58.230
<i>Clop-clop-clop on a moonlit night</i>

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:59.340
All's well that ends well I guess.

00:21:58.360 --> 00:22:02.480
<i>They gather to the clopping of geta</i>

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:02.030
Dad.

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:06.280
<i>Daddy Eyeball in his bath bowl</i>

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:07.030
Thanks to him,
I've had a lot to think about.

00:22:06.410 --> 00:22:09.620
<i>A single lecture and everyone consents</i>

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:11.790
And the reason I'm here right now...

00:22:09.740 --> 00:22:17.500
<i>We teach the rampant ones a lesson</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:13.500
is thanks to you...

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:16.920
and everyone here.

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:19.360
Thank you for helping me.

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:22.750
<i>We can't just do nothing</i>

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:22.860
I hope I can continue to count on you all.

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:27.890
<i>To the mysterious GeGeGe Forest</i>

00:22:25.880 --> 00:22:28.700
Hah! Talk about stating the obvious!

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:30.930
<i>Take a deep breath together</i>

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:30.930
That's so embarrassing I might fart!

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:37.270
<i>So we can live happily</i>

00:22:31.680 --> 00:22:33.620
Don't you dare! Do it and I'll kiss you!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:35.120
-Eww!
-What do you mean, "eww"?!

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:37.330
-I'll kiss you deeply!
-Eww, eww, eww!

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:39.230
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>A </i>yokai<i> disrupting a woodland development</i>
<i>and a mysterious shadow...</i>

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:07.970
<i>Dad, that's...</i>

00:23:08.510 --> 00:23:10.610
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:12.700
<i>"Nurarihyon's Ambition"</i>

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:15.060
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
